OL,3,AHundreds of prisoners being let out
OL,4,Atoday as early release scheme starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of prisoners across England
OL,7,Fand Wales are being released early
OL,8,Ftoday under a new scheme designed to
OL,9,Ffree-up prison space
OL,11,FOffenders serving sentences of up to 19
OL,12,Fmonths are now eligible for release
OL,13,Fafter a third of their term - here's a
OL,14,Fquick look at how the scheme will work
OL,16,FPrisoners being released early today
OL,17,Fwill include those convicted of fraud,
OL,18,Fdomestic abuse, and coercive control
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
