OL,3,AHundreds of prisoners being let out
OL,4,Atoday as early release scheme starts
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I am scared that he will come after me
OL,7,F- I don't want to die," one victim
OL,8,Ftells us - while another woman says
OL,9,Fshe's suffering "night terrors and
OL,10,Fpanic"
OL,12,FRestriction zones will control the
OL,13,Fmovements of the most serious
OL,14,Foffenders, while the government
OL,15,Fpromises a record roll-out of ankle
OL,16,Fmonitors
OL,18,FThere are expected to be around 4,500
OL,19,Freleases as part of the phased scheme -
OL,20,Ftoday's is just the first round
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
